  "schema": "myjewl.deliverable_geometry_table.v0_1",
  "source_rationale": "The exact export bytes a Rhino receipt vouches for, delivered verbatim. Rhino/Grasshopper is the sole geometry authority and the model never hand-authors geometry, so this repository's own manifold3d union -- watertight, single-bodied, and the basis of the quote -- is measured but never delivered: it is not Rhino's output, and it is computed from meshes whose winding was repaired in memory, which would ship a silent fix for a defect that is still open at the source. See docs/geometry_delivery_2026-08-17.md."
